    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/70/Felicia_catgirl_Dreamer.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241112035933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Felicia catgirl Dreamer\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/70/Felicia_catgirl_Dreamer.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241112035933\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"595\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Felicia catgirl Dreamer.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Felicia_catgirl_Dreamer.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eFeline Dreamer\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA cat woman who is a musical star in the human realm. She throws herself into the fight among Darkstalkers without much thought, only that beating up bad guys call for peace. Abandoned as child yet kindhearted, she found an orphanage to share her happiness with everyone.\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Felicidades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241101200259\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Felicidades Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Felicidades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241101200259\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"933\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Felicidades Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Felicidades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003